{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/extras/02-20250219\uc804\ud22c1.gif?t=1749137454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time to Hunt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mini Star Quest</i> is a turn-based action game. Collect tickets to recruit Questers, assemble multiple powerful parties, and take down massive enemies in style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own unique parties! Take up to 3 parties on a single quest simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge short quests with a single party, or tackle long-term battles with up to 3 parties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests and collect tickets to recruit adorable Questers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into colorful and exciting turn-based action!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/extras/03-20250219\uc804\ud22c\uc0c1\uc810.gif?t=1749137454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Colorful Strategic Turn-Based Action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine classes and attributes effectively, and manage turns and skill points strategically to complete quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/extras/01-20250219\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc120\ud0dd\ucc3d.gif?t=1749137454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multi-Party System for Each Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully organize one or up to three parties and challenge quests your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/extras/04-20250219\ud30c\ud2f0\ud30c\uad34.gif?t=1749137454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>10 Classes, 9 Attributes, and 108 Questers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best part? These numbers will keep growing with continuous updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491430?t=1749137454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491430?t=1749137454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/694f858bf49dad7e1e1ef04cc160b33eb47a6edd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749137454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/694f858bf49dad7e1e1ef04cc160b33eb47a6edd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749137454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3497500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491430/extras/02-20250219\uc804\ud22c1.gif?t=1749137454\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time to Hunt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mini Star Quest</i> is a turn-based action game. Collect tickets to recruit Questers, assemble multiple powerful parties, and take down massive enemies in style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own unique parties! Take up to 3 parties on a single quest simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge short quests with a single party, or tackle long-term battles with up to 3 parties!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests and collect tickets to recruit adorable Questers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into colorful and 